<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρσῐν-ος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρρῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρτινος</span>
			, <i>of myrtle</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρον</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					202
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Androm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.687
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.114
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρρινος, ὁ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσίνη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.3.3
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσίνη</span> (with or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμίλη</span>), ἡ,
				<i>convex scalpel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.477
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρρινον, τό</span>, <i>upper part of membrum</i>
			<i>virile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				964
			</span></i>.</div>
